<title>USA: Seven-Up/RC names Brodkin chairman.</title>
<headline>Seven-Up/RC names Brodkin chairman.</headline>
<dateline>VERNON, Calif. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seven-Up/RC Bottling Co of Southern California said that president and chief executive officer Barton Brodkin was elected to the additional position of chairman of the board.</p>
<p>The company also said Rick Ferguson was promoted to the position of executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The details on who he succeeded were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
